.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/solventum-solv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[17,15,2,25.07],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[2,2,0,2.95,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":1,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0367,"r5":0.0187,"r1_spy":0.0336,"r5_spy":-0.0142,"r1_sector":0.0373,"r5_sector":0.0029,"etf":"XLV"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2024-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"This is a restructuring project we are calling the Solventum Way.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2024-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Bryan covered the Solventum Way restructuring project, which touches every segment, function and region in the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2024-08-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"And we’re raising our full-year outlook as we continue to progress our plans to get this business to where we expect it to be.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2024-08-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"For earnings per share, we are raising our guidance to $6.30 to $6.50 and on our improved sales outlook and favorable estimated tax rate.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"If I just think about the tariffs, I think, first and foremost, we just need to see what actually happens here.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"And as a result of that, just given what we know, I really don't see tariffs as being a major impact to our business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"We also continue to advance our planning for the Solventum Way restructuring project.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"By streamlining time, by streamlining cost of producing, reducing risk during scaling and boosting overall productivity with a clear goal of helping companies bring therapies to market more quickly and with less risk.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"…data point that speaks to the team's overall progress in this transformation and the success of our business continuity efforts, which we clearly see as being reflected in both the performance in the quarter and our ability to raise our full year guidance for the second consecutive quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2024-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"For earnings per share, we are raising our guidance to $6.50 to $6.65 on our improved sales outlook and stronger Q3 gross margins.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2025-02-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Before we move on, regarding tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2025-02-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Our guidance does not assume any tariff impact at this time, given the current dynamic environment and an inability to predict potential financial impact.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2025-02-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Vikramjeet Chopra","x":"How much flexibility you have to move production elsewhere and to take price to offset any tariff impact?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2025-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Now stopping that decline and reversing it especially amid a complex separation, global restructuring, a talent and cultural transformation and a significant divestiture process, any of which pose real risk to business continuity represents a major achievement for this team.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2024 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2025-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"And we've implemented a global restructuring through our Solventum Way program to ensure that our structure also supports this culture.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2025-05-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"And as a result of this positive momentum, favorable FX and decisive steps we've taken to mitigate the impact of known tariffs, we are raising our organic revenue guidance and confirming EPS for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2025-05-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Before we jump into the strong start for the year, let me just quickly address tariffs specifically and Wayde will provide more details in a minute.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2025-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"And as we've mentioned, our AI-driven autonomous coating technology really focuses on streamlining the coating process to help save our customer’s time and money.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2025-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Savings from the recent restructuring are on track and will continue to ramp through the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2025-05-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Starting with full year organic sales growth, we are increasing our outlook to a range of 1.5% to 2.5%, an increase of 50 basis points above our prior guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Switching to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Offset the tariff impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Our recent new product launches, and our commercial restructuring to specialize the sales channel in our growth driver areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"The ongoing success of 360 Encompass HIS' ability to streamline workflows, and deliver meaningful customer benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Starting with full-year organic sales growth, we have increased our outlook to a range of 2% to 3% a 50 basis point increase above our prior guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2025-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Altogether, for earnings per share, we have increased our guidance to a range of $5.80 to $5.95 from the previous guidance of $5.45 to $5.65.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/solventum-solv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"So something we had always contemplated, and certainly, you can imagine the focus on it because of tariffs is pretty high.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/solventum-solv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"What we do have to highlight is that obviously, tariffs are going to be the assumptions that are in place today, they will be more of a headwind next year, and that will pressure operating margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/solventum-solv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan C. Hanson","x":"The commercial restructuring and enhancements we executed last year are rapidly delivering results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/solventum-solv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"Operating expenses increased by $3 million to $739 million, driven mainly by an increase in equity compensation and other benefits, which were partially offset by the P&F sale and further savings from our Solventum Way restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/solventum-solv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2026-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"During the year, we were able to absorb tariff headwinds and expand operating margins off of the Q4 2024 baseline while continuing to invest in commercial enhancements and innovation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/solventum-solv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2026-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"Operating margins finished at 20.5%, within our assumptions of 20% to 21%, while absorbing 65 basis points of tariff impacts that were not contemplated at the beginning of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/solventum-solv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2026-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"We do have several areas in the business where we have the ability to raise price, and we do.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/solventum-solv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2026-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan C. Hanson","x":"And building on the foundation of our Salesforce restructuring project, our revitalized innovation process has meaningfully increased our vitality index.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/solventum-solv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2025 Q4","e":"solv","d":"2026-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayde D. McMillan","x":"We also completed the Solventum Way restructuring program, exceeding expectations and delivering annualized savings of approximately $125 million at a lower total cost of $90 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/solventum-solv-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2026-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"Shifting gears to tariffs, we continue to expect the annual headwinds to be in the range of $100 million to $120 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/solventum-solv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2026-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"From the very beginning, our supply chain teams have been actively working on mitigation strategies since we first saw tariff headwinds emerge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/solventum-solv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"We are streamlining systems, increasing automation, and optimizing our global footprint while repositioning spend toward the highest-return areas of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/solventum-solv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q1","e":"solv","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"With further work to streamline our distribution centers, we are now down to 54 worldwide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/solventum-solv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"The performance includes a onetime tariff refund benefit of $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/solventum-solv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"Excluding the refund, our gross margins were approximately 55.6%, consistent with our expectations and 40 basis points lower compared to prior year, driven by tariff impact of 150 basis points and inflation headwinds, partially offset by programmatic savings and portfolio optimization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/solventum-solv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Frederick Wise","x":"There'll be cost savings, et cetera, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/solventum-solv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Frederick Wise","x":"Where do you take off your foot, maybe where do you put your foot on the gas pedal and redeploy people, spend -- invest, spend the cost savings and -- how do we think about the potential accelerant impacts once it's all done?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/solventum-solv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q2","e":"solv","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"But on a full year basis, we're very happy to be raising our guide again to that 3.5% to 4% on an ex SKU basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/solventum-solv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Hanson","x":"…supply continuity for the critical materials that leverage our intellectual property; and second, it's an important variable in our ability to improve year-over-year margins in 2027, particularly given the known tariff headwinds created by the onetime tariff refund we received in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/solventum-solv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"The year-over-year improvement reflects continued benefits from programmatic savings, portfolio optimization and operating improvements, partially offset by inflation and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/solventum-solv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"For free cash flow, we maintain our outlook for $200 million to $300 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/solventum-solv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SOLV 2026 Q3","e":"solv","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wayde McMillan","x":"So as you know, we increased our guide last quarter from 2% to 3% to 2.5% to 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/solventum-solv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[58,1,7806,0,0,0,6513,1029],[59,1,9452,0,0,0,7573,1554],[60,1,9120,0,0,0,7244,1527],[61,1,6815,0,0,0,5413,1079],[62,1,8448,0,0,0,6426,1617],[63,1,2312,0,0,0,1621,575],[64,1,10760,0,0,0,9713,653],[65,1,6966,0,0,0,5733,748],[66,1,9038,0,0,0,7294,1442],[67,1,6855,0,0,0,5780,744]],"cinema":[[58,1,7806,0,0,0,6513,1029],[59,1,9452,0,0,0,7573,1554],[60,1,9120,0,0,0,7244,1527],[61,1,6815,0,0,0,5413,1079],[62,1,8448,0,0,0,6426,1617],[63,1,2312,0,0,0,1621,575],[64,1,10760,0,0,0,9713,653],[65,1,6966,0,0,0,5733,748],[66,1,9038,0,0,0,7294,1442],[67,1,6855,0,0,0,5780,744]],"imax":[[58,1,7806,0,0,0,6513,1029],[59,1,9452,0,0,0,7573,1554],[60,1,9120,0,0,0,7244,1527],[61,1,6815,0,0,0,5413,1079],[62,1,8448,0,0,0,6426,1617],[63,1,2312,0,0,0,1621,575],[64,1,10760,0,0,0,9713,653],[65,1,6966,0,0,0,5